                            <comment id="15528941" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 28 Sep 2016 08:45:44 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user rajarajan-g opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1467&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1467&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1488&quot; title=&quot;JDBC Intrepreter throws error while the interpreter is downloading dependencies&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-1488&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-1488&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  JDBC Interpreter throws error while the interpreter is downloading dependencies&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
